      "content": "but its different this time. it wasnt just some mistake, i actually caused real damage. i feel like a parasite. and the more i think about it, the more i realize that everyone would just be lighter, happier, if i just wasn't around to mess things up. it feels like the only honest thing left to do is to stop being a burden.",
